circuit "555 astable LED blinker"
part U1 ne555
part R1 resistor 1k
part R2 resistor 47k
part C1 capacitor 10uF
part C2 capacitor 10nF
part R3 resistor 330
part D1 led red

U1.VCC -- VCC
U1.RESET -- VCC
U1.GND -- GND
VCC -- R1.1
R1.2 -- U1.DIS -- R2.1
R2.2 -- U1.THR -- U1.TRIG -- C1.1
C1.2 -- GND
U1.CTRL -- C2.1
C2.2 -- GND
U1.OUT -- R3.1
R3.2 -- D1.anode
D1.cathode -- GND
